e file is a mirror of nvidia's — `amd/model.py:239-247` matches\n`nvidia/model.py:239-247` by grep **[M]**) → `Qwen3NextSparseMoeBlock` → `FusedMoEFactory` →\n`FusedTopKRouter` → `fused_topk` → **`rocm_aiter_ops.topk_softmax` if\n`rocm_aiter_ops.is_fused_moe_enabled()` else `ops.topk_softmax`**\n(`router/fused_topk_router.py:64-69`, `:106-111`) → experts kernel from `oracle/fp8.py`\n(`rocm_aiter_moe` at `:204`, with an aiter skip predicate at `:409-414` falling back to\n`TritonExperts`). **No triton_kernels, no `N_EXPTS_ACT`.** **[S]**\n\n"}],"details":{}}}
