{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 11 instrument tests pass; the full repo suite (20 tests including repo invariants) also passes. Next, commit on the designated branch. Check git status, stage only files within the conflict domains (container/rootfs/*, tests/*), and commit. Verify the worklist? \"Don't read other tasks from the worklist.\" OK.\n\nCommit message convention from log: \"container-recipe: ...\", \"receipts: ...\", \"handoff: ...\". Use \"instruments: ...\".\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"All green — acceptance criteria pass, and the full repo suite (20 tests) stays clean. Committing on the assigned branch:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9fe9c701d1cc44f0a5d954a2","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/ed7013e7b4ab/instruments && git status --porcelain && git add container/rootfs/fn_synctrace.py container/rootfs/fn_offload_batch.py container/rootfs/fn_expert_union.py tests/test_instruments.py && git -c user.name=\"tally-worker\" -c user.email=\"tally@localhost\" commit -m \"instruments: adapt ds4-vllm engagement-proof instruments into the container overlay\n\nLands the three FN_ instruments under container/rootfs/ (COPY'd to the top\nof site-packages by the Containerfile, importable as bare names):\n\n- fn_synctrace.py: wraps the handful of Tensor methods that force a blocking\n  device->host sync (~25 events/step), driven from the FN_PROFILE window;\n  no env var of its own, install()/uninstall() bracket the window.\n- fn_offload_batch.py: store-batch and promote budget helpers fixing the\n  upstream offload ratchet defect; env FN_OFFLOAD_STORE_BATCH_FRAC and\n  FN_OFFLOAD_PROMOTE_FRAC (<= 0 restores stock); torch-free by design.\n- fn_expert_union.py: counts distinct routed experts per decode step; the\n  upstream wrap targeted the gpt-oss make_routing_data entry this workload\n  never calls, so the wrap is re-targeted onto the stock fused-mixture router\n  entry fused_topk in fused_topk_router.py (qsa-53896.md section 4), reading\n  num_local_experts off gating_output's shape with no device sync. Kill\n  switch FN_EXPERT_UNION, default off; FN_EU_START/FN_EU_CALLS/FN_EU_OUT.\n\nEvery module carries an Adapted-from notice naming the upstream file\n(AlexKGwyn/ds4-vllm @ a8f620d) and its Apache-2.0 license.\n\ntests/test_instruments.py: py_compile + notice-header + FN_ env-surface\nchecks for all three, and the fn_offload_batch reference invariants\n(store floor clamps to the max group size; promote counted in blocks;\n<= 0 frac / degenerate specs return None). Host-runnable without torch.\" && git log --oneline -2 && git status --porcelain"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":655,"output":670,"cacheRead":57344,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":106,"totalTokens":58669,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787988563839,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8d08b92f-eb60-4640-bd0b-ac8ca7363770","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9fe9c701d1cc44f0a5d954a2","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"?? container/rootfs/fn_expert_union.py\n?? container/rootfs/fn_offload_batch.py\n?? container/rootfs/fn_synctrace.py\n?? tests/test_instruments.py\n[tally-work/flashnext-ed7013e7b4ab/instruments 9a3e54d] instruments: adapt ds4-vllm engagement-proof instruments into the container overlay\n 4 files changed, 581 insertions(+)\n create mode 100644 container/rootfs/fn_expert_union.py\n create mode 100644 container/rootfs/fn_offload_batch.py\n create mode 100644 container/rootfs/fn_synctrace.py\n create mode 100644 tests/test_instruments.py\n9a3e54d instruments: adapt ds4-vllm engagement-proof instruments into the container overlay\nc1363cb container-recipe: Container recipe: pinned wheel set + engine fork b